-- נספח א'2 — טבלת שכר למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102), מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2022: the second-degree (MA)
-- combined-salary table of the reform from 1.9.2022, as the corpus
-- publishes it among the tables. It is annex א2 of the wage agreement of
-- 19.10.2022, which §4.1 makes the table from 1.9.2022 and which the
-- agreement's signed copy prints after its signatures (the corpus's own
-- reading of those pages; encoded, imported). The page is that copy's: the
-- annex label, the hand-written page number, the label of the next annex at its foot and the parties' initialled note that the annexes are agreed.
--
-- Checked here over every cell: the table is the signed copy's annex א2
-- cell for cell, and it prints the day §4.1 applies it from. Like that
-- annex it is printed to the shekel; the follow-up committee's decision of
-- 14.1.2025 (§3, imported) replaced it by a table printed to the agora,
-- from the same day, and every cell here is that table's to the nearest
-- shekel. A rule that pays by this table pays the decision's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספח א'2 — טבלת השכר למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102), 1.9.2022`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח א' 2"; the table below is that annex.

-- The table prints under it "טבלה מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2022": the day §4.1
-- applies it from (asserted below).
@ref akn:hc_1/p3
`annex א'2 of 1.9.2022 is updated from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022

@ref akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/t1
